<title>GERMANY: BfG 1996 H1 oper profit falls 19 pct.</title>
<headline>BfG 1996 H1 oper profit falls 19 pct.</headline>
<dateline>FRANKFURT 1996-09-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Six months to June 30</p>
<p>(in millions of marks unless otherwise stated)</p>
<p>    Oper profit after provisions	   94     vs 116</p>
<p>    Net bad debt provisions		  25     vs 43</p>
<p>    Partial operating profit		 129    vs 130</p>
<p>NOTE - Full name of the German bank is BfG Bank AG. Partial operating profit comprises net interest and commission income minus operating costs.</p>
</text>
